        "Description": "Good evening 47 our client a former Kronstadt engineer has requested the aid of the ICA to dispose of some of their former colleauges. Our client stated the targets had a hand in their removal from the company.\r\rNotes from Diana\r\rEllen Ives: one of your targets hes been known to be a frequant snacker of the nuts in the confrence room. Perhaps he could use a bit of spice?\r\rLucas Mclaughlin: another one of your targets hes been known to stand a bit close to the railing.\r\rGood luck 47",
